# ─── App (product) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTA: hoy sin uso — "Iniciar sesión" / "Crear cuenta" están ocultos en el
# Nav (código comentado en components/v2/Nav.tsx y next.config.ts) porque las
# URLs no resuelven todavía. Se documentan acá para cuando se habilite el
# acceso a la plataforma.
# Full URLs (including path/query) of the login and signup screens on the
# actual product app (apps/app), which "Iniciar sesión" / "Crear cuenta" in
# the nav link to. Separate vars so each can change independently later
# (e.g. signup gets its own query param) without touching the other — for
# now both point at the same sign-in screen.
# Local dev: apps/app's own dev port (see apps/app/package.json).
# Production: path-based on the main domain, e.g.
# https://modulariot.com/app/sign-in (reverse-proxied to apps/app) — set via
# the hosting platform's env vars.
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_LOGIN_URL=http://localhost:3050/sign-in
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_SIGNUP_URL=http://localhost:3050/sign-in
